== facts of an implementation, read back from its .cmt
present: true
digest: checks 9 (ascription 3 argument 1 interface 5) deps 17 (definition 3 alias 3 with 1 interface 10) equalities 1 omissions 1 (unresolved-module 1)
check ascription M : S
check argument M : S
check ascription Snapshotted : Snapshot
check ascription Wrapper.N : Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper
check interface Mtf_aux : <Mtf_aux>
check interface M : <[intf]M>
check interface F : <[intf]F>
check interface Wrapper.N : <[intf]Wrapper.N>
check interface Wrapper : <[intf]Wrapper>
dep S -interface-> [intf]S
dep T -interface-> [intf]T
dep T -definition-> <#1>
dep Container -interface-> [intf]Container
dep Container -definition-> <#2>
dep Snapshot -definition-> <#3>
dep Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper -alias-> S
dep Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper -interface-> [intf]Wrapper.Inner@[intf]Wrapper
dep Container.Local@body(Container) -alias-> S
dep <S> -alias-> S
dep <#1> -with-> S
dep <M> -interface-> S
dep <Wrapper.N> -interface-> Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper
dep <Container.Member> -interface-> S
dep <#2> -interface-> Container.Local@body(Container)
dep <#2> -interface-> <Container.Member>
dep <Snapshotted> -interface-> Snapshot
equal F(M) = FM
omission: affected=<#3> source=none reason=unresolved-module
== facts of an interface, read back from its .cmti
present: true
digest: checks 0 deps 22 (definition 2 alias 3 with 1 functor-type 1 interface 15) equalities 0 omissions 0
dep T -definition-> <#1>
dep Container -definition-> <#2>
dep Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper -alias-> S
dep Container.Local@body(Container) -alias-> S
dep <Mtf_aux> -interface-> S
dep <Mtf_aux> -interface-> T
dep <Mtf_aux> -interface-> Container
dep <Mtf_aux> -interface-> <M>
dep <Mtf_aux> -interface-> <F>
dep <Mtf_aux> -interface-> <Wrapper>
dep <S> -alias-> S
dep <#1> -with-> S
dep <M> -interface-> S
dep <#3> -functor-type-> <S>
dep <F> -interface-> <#3>
dep <Wrapper.N> -interface-> Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper
dep <#4> -interface-> Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper
dep <#4> -interface-> <Wrapper.N>
dep <Wrapper> -interface-> <#4>
dep <Container.Member> -interface-> S
dep <#2> -interface-> Container.Local@body(Container)
dep <#2> -interface-> <Container.Member>
== the interface pairs of the unit are directional
pair S <- [intf]S
pair T <- [intf]T
pair Container <- [intf]Container
pair Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper <- [intf]Wrapper.Inner@[intf]Wrapper
== .cms and .cmsi hold the same facts as .cmt and .cmti
present: cms true cmsi true
cms = cmt: true
cmsi = cmti: true
digest: checks 9 (ascription 3 argument 1 interface 5) deps 17 (definition 3 alias 3 with 1 interface 10) equalities 1 omissions 1 (unresolved-module 1)
check ascription M : S
check argument M : S
check ascription Snapshotted : Snapshot
check ascription Wrapper.N : Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper
check interface Mtf_aux : <Mtf_aux>
check interface M : <[intf]M>
check interface F : <[intf]F>
check interface Wrapper.N : <[intf]Wrapper.N>
check interface Wrapper : <[intf]Wrapper>
dep S -interface-> [intf]S
dep T -interface-> [intf]T
dep T -definition-> <#1>
dep Container -interface-> [intf]Container
dep Container -definition-> <#2>
dep Snapshot -definition-> <#3>
dep Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper -alias-> S
dep Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper -interface-> [intf]Wrapper.Inner@[intf]Wrapper
dep Container.Local@body(Container) -alias-> S
dep <S> -alias-> S
dep <#1> -with-> S
dep <M> -interface-> S
dep <Wrapper.N> -interface-> Wrapper.Inner@Wrapper
dep <Container.Member> -interface-> S
dep <#2> -interface-> Container.Local@body(Container)
dep <#2> -interface-> <Container.Member>
dep <Snapshotted> -interface-> Snapshot
equal F(M) = FM
omission: affected=<#3> source=none reason=unresolved-module
== facts of a unit whose expectations come from a .cmi
present: true
digest: checks 10 (ascription 9 argument 1) deps 13 (definition 1 alias 1 with 1 strengthen 2 interface 8) equalities 1 omissions 0
check argument A : Mtf_aux.S
check ascription M : Mtf_aux.S
check ascription Mtf_aux.M : Mtf_aux.S
check ascription Container.Member : Mtf_aux.S
check ascription Q : Mtf_aux.T
check ascription Container : Mtf_aux.Container
check ascription P : Local
check ascription N : Mtf_aux.Wrapper.Inner@Mtf_aux.Wrapper
check ascription R : <#1>
check ascription Container.Member : <Mtf_aux.Container.Member>
dep Local -definition-> <#2>
dep Mtf_aux.Container.Local@Container -interface-> Container.Local@Container
dep Container.Local@Container -alias-> Mtf_aux.S
dep <M> -interface-> Mtf_aux.S
dep <N> -interface-> Mtf_aux.Wrapper.Inner@Mtf_aux.Wrapper
dep <#2> -with-> Mtf_aux.S
dep <P> -interface-> Local
dep <Q> -interface-> Mtf_aux.T
dep <#1> -strengthen-> Mtf_aux.S
dep <#1> -strengthen-> <Mtf_aux.M>
dep <R> -interface-> <#1>
dep <Container.Member> -interface-> Mtf_aux.S
dep <Container> -interface-> Mtf_aux.Container
equal Mtf_aux.F(A) = FA
== an ascription against another unit's signature is no pair
mtf_aux, which has an .mli: interface checks 5, interface pairs 4
mtf_client, which has none: interface checks 0, interface pairs 0
== the parameter expectation of a functor loaded from a .cmi
loaded from the .cmi: Mtf_aux.S
after substitution: Mtf_aux.S
after strengthening: Mtf_aux.S
== the interface a unit is an argument for
digest: checks 1 (interface 1) deps 0 equalities 0 omissions 0
check interface Mtf_argument : <Mtf_param>
== a partial artifact carries no facts
partial implementation: true
present: false
digest: checks 0 deps 0 equalities 0 omissions 0
== facts are only extracted for the artifacts that are written
mtf_gate_cmt: cmt true, cms no artifact
mtf_gate_cms: cmt no artifact, cms true
mtf_gate_none: cmt no artifact, cms no artifact
